From 84ef6bd528015476a24aa380717c8434e7bbfa34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brandon Williams <turbine.bmw@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:43:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2368/2368] media: camss: import the validated C-PHY clock and
 paired RAW statistics changes

Bring the source up to the working SP11 snapshot: account for C-PHY throughput in clock selection, emit PIX frame-start events, share the sensor stream between RAW and PIX, and pair completions with the physical frame sequence.

